WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:09.306
Hi! After 10 come 11, 12 and on up to 20. Today we'll learn numbers up to 20.

2
00:00:09.456 --> 00:00:12.978
Bundle 10 ones together and you get 1 ten.

3
00:00:13.128 --> 00:00:16.674
14 is 1 ten and 4 ones.

4
00:00:16.824 --> 00:00:21.066
11 is eleven, 12 is twelve, 20 is twenty.

5
00:00:21.216 --> 00:00:28.794
From 13 to 19, the English words end in teen: thirteen, fourteen.

6
00:00:28.944 --> 00:00:36.834
17 and 12 have the same tens, so compare the ones: 7 is more than 2, so 17 is greater.

7
00:00:36.984 --> 00:00:41.562
2 more than 15 is 17, and 2 less is 13.

8
00:00:41.712 --> 00:00:47.538
12, 14, 16 goes up by 2 each time, so next is 18.

9
00:00:47.688 --> 00:00:51.330
20 is 2 tens.

10
00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:56.154
Watch out! Don't mix up the 1 and the 4 in 14!

11
00:00:56.304 --> 00:01:02.682
The 1 on the left is the tens: 1 ten. The 4 on the right is the ones: 4 ones.

12
00:01:02.832 --> 00:01:07.866
So 14 is 1 ten and 4 ones.

13
00:01:08.016 --> 00:01:16.386
Your turn! What is 1 ten and 6 ones? Pause and think.

14
00:01:16.536 --> 00:01:22.050
10 and 6 make 16. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:30.882
Another one! How many tens and ones are in 19? Pause and think.

16
00:01:31.032 --> 00:01:37.194
19 is 1 ten and 9 ones. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:37.344 --> 00:01:46.386
Here's another! Which is greater, 13 or 18? Pause and think.

18
00:01:46.536 --> 00:01:53.802
Same tens, and 8 is more than 3, so 18 is greater. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:53.952 --> 00:02:02.346
Try one more! What is 2 more than 17? Pause and think.

20
00:02:02.496 --> 00:02:09.594
17, 18, 19: it's 19. Did you get it right?

21
00:02:09.744 --> 00:02:19.458
Try one more! 10, 12, 14. What comes next? Pause and think.

22
00:02:19.608 --> 00:02:25.626
Up by 2 each time, so 16. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:25.776 --> 00:02:33.882
Try one more! Which numeral is fifteen? Pause and think.

24
00:02:34.032 --> 00:02:39.066
Fifteen is 15. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:39.216 --> 00:02:47.490
Try one more! What is 3 less than 20? Pause and think.

26
00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:54.162
Count back 3: 19, 18, 17. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:54.312 --> 00:03:03.090
Last one! Which is greater, 18 or 11? Pause and think.

28
00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:10.457
Same tens, and 8 is more than 1, so 18 is greater. Did you get it right?

29
00:03:10.607 --> 00:03:17.802
Remember: 11 to 19 are one ten and some ones. If the tens match, compare the ones.

30
00:03:17.952 --> 00:03:21.497
Count the steps at home!

